review_comments.body_text:
I don't think we need a new ArcWithPtr wrapper, the following may work:
pub tracked struct ArcPointsTo<T: 'static> {
    perm: Exclusive<&'static PointsTo<T>>,
}

And arc_from_raw and arc_into_raw will just consume this token.

