review_comments.body_text:
I believe there is no elegant solution for this now. The ptr method is unsound, so we can not use it. Maybe we can just use
pub tracked struct ArcPointsTo<T: 'static> {
    perm: &'static PointsTo<T>,
}

for now and leave arc_into_raw and arc_from_raw as they are, without an ArcWithPtr. And we should document the issue.

